{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_mostma_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_mostma_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"高楼之上","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mostma_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e73a63dea7e92147cda4305668fb43b8b38c9be97fbd78a1fed15c4160fedf35","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"今天的能天使也一如既往地以她的方式进行着送货。而她所不知道的是，在不远处的屋顶，有一个人正在看着她。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 莫斯提马"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，让我看看，五个，不对，六个吗，来吧，我赶时间，你们一起上吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"龙门的巷子中，今天的能天使也一如既往地以她的方式进行着送货。\n而她所不知道的是，在不远处的屋顶，有一个人正在看着她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rooftop_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，小乐还是这么爱玩，枪法也变得越来越好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你也这么认为吧，看得我都有点怀念我的铳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"找罗德岛定制一把铳型法杖？还是算了......要是让蕾缪安看到可要笑话我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"而且那不是会搞得我好像很怀念过去一样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我不怎么怀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，不怀念，不代表忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"时过境迁，物是人非，我以为你会对这一点有更深的感触。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......也对，你们的感受性和我们并不相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我有时候也很好奇，以百年为单位的变迁究竟是怎样的感觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是细微的感情会变得毫无意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，我向来没什么所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，果然是莫斯提马。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"伊斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"中午好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝有事找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"并没有。最近没有什么大活，我也只是路过，然后感到了熟悉的气息就过来看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的是......能天使？原来如此，例行公事吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。顺便和这家伙透透气，聊聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那可真是惬意，令人羡慕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"一如既往，闲不下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里哪里，天生劳碌命罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，既然正好遇到你，麻烦你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"请说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙最近跟我抱怨了很多次，或许是锁的零件出了点问题，可能要麻烦你帮我看一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，安魂夜你交给我保管的时候我就觉得锁有些古旧了，说不定会有些小问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我吧，小事一桩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"另一把不需要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，毕竟它在锁里，另一把只是钥匙，不会烦我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫斯提马拍了拍腰间的灰色法杖，然后将棕色法杖抽出，递给了伊斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"老朋友，又见面了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦，看来它确实心情不是很好，并不想理会我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"常有的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，莫斯提马，之前我一直没有问，不过，我可以好奇一下，这对锁与钥匙你是在哪里获得的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"它在来到我手上之前，一直在卡兹戴尔附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔附近......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到会在那一带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"具体的嘛，虽然我觉得告诉你也没关系，不过解释起来会很麻烦，所以还是算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"解释......是对那位黎博利小姐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，你见过她了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"之前安魂夜的时候见过一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"很麻烦的女人对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“嘣！”忽然之间，一根弩箭扎在莫斯提马和伊斯身前的不远处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我并不受这位小姐欢迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不，她只是在朝我发火而已，还有别的问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"仔细想想，虽然我是因为你和大帝才加入企鹅物流，不过在加入之后，我们很少好好聊过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"有关它的问题，你可以随时问我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......你有想过去找它的另外几片碎片吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"它现在只剩下这一份碎片了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"而且就算有，它不是很感兴趣，我更不感兴趣，就像现在这样就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，如果它真的不想，从一开始就不会变成这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，确实是这个道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这样的存在，有不少都是做出了这样的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我也问过它，有没有想过出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"让我想想，对了，是在罗德岛的干员测试的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......因为我觉得那个组织很有意思，所以久违地想要展现一下自己？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"也有可能是想要吓一吓博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不过最后它放弃了，好像是感觉到了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不得不说，罗德岛确实是个有趣的组织，伊斯你有空了也可以去看一看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"等我有空的话，我会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候有空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢，大帝哪天心情不好的时候，我可能就有空了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，人与人之间的际遇确实足够奇妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"它在沉眠之后，会遇到与它如此契合的持有者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然要我说的话，这家伙给我带来的麻烦，要远比力量多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不在乎，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，今天就聊到这里吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"杖没问题了我会通知你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"好，拜拜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"火气这么大？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"拜你所赐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不胜荣幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人究竟是什么人物，我只知道大帝了不得，从不知道企鹅物流里还有这样的人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然会把杖交给他，而且他好像很熟悉这些的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"他是可以说这些的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不能信任，刚才就不是一发弩箭的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你想知道吗？我可以告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......免了。老家伙们明显也知道，但是没有告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"这也就意味着，我不应该从你口中得知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样不累吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我的职责只是监视你，除此之外，我不关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，所以说，让你当年自告奋勇接下监视我的任务，很多事没法知道，还要跟着我跑东跑西，给自己找罪受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"明知故问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，卡兹戴尔那件事你不需要负任何责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那并不是你在场就能让我不用扣下扳机的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"而你也不在乎变成现在这样，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，你也变得越来越了解我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己选的，不用你来操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧——对了，昨天公证所的人来了吧，有新的任务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时没有，例行报告而已。不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？难道你的职位又变了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"没错......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"这么不开心，说出来让我开心一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦难陈述者？","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......独臂电锯侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......他们刚看了龙门产的烂片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我带回去的。啧，早知道给他们带点艺术电影回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈，哈，然后你下一次就会叫铳与玫瑰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"至少比独臂电锯侠强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你打算跟着她一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我看起来有那么无聊吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我个人认为，在这片大地上，比你无聊的人不会很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我的评价有这么高？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我没在夸你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得你在夸我就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我确实没那个打算，只是惯例来看一眼，我又不是第一天这么做了，你也不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。你不主动和她接触对我来说是一件好事，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"自从上次安魂夜我和她聊了几句后，你好像一直在担心这个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是担心我会和她接触，告诉她一些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有这个想法，我可能拦不住你，所以我必须了解你在这件事上的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的眼神，今天要是不告诉你，你是不打算让我离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"对付你，来硬的要比讲道理有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......你认为，让一个人真的不在乎你的方法是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"消失在这个人的生活里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不够，如果你出现过，你就无法完全消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你要等到这个人找到新的生活，新的环境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，一开始我也没想到她会从拉特兰跑到这里来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝告诉我她也加入了企鹅物流的时候，我还是相当吃惊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也知道，我从那时候起，直到安魂夜，都没有和她见过面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"安魂夜那一次嘛......算是狂欢的一部分吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"她不会就此放弃找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但她实际上并没有在找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那件事与她没有直接的联系，而我们都不得不对此缄口不言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我能告诉她吗，告诉我，独臂电锯侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"求你不要一本正经地喊这个名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，这是最高机密，你不能告诉她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，她最想知道的事情我无法告诉她，那我出现在她面前干什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"和她说一些不痛不痒的话，勾起她的好奇心，把她卷进这边的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望她不在乎你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你不这么希望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过了，从职责上不希望她继续关注和你有关的事，作为我个人，我不是很在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，如果你问我希不希望，我不会说我希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但我轻易地割舍掉了我与拉特兰的关联，就好像我当时毫不犹豫地举起我的铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能说，如果事情发生了，那就让它发生吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实是这样的人，我也是不喜欢你这一点，你总是不在乎失去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人都不喜欢我这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但我反而很好奇，在乎失去又能怎么样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你为你失去的东西和预见到将会失去的东西痛哭流涕，那然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不打算和你讨论哲学话题。只是既然你这么想，那为什么还要这样来看她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"猜不出，我想你不至于无聊到抱着被她发现的想法在做这样的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会是刚看了什么地摊言情小说吧，少看点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，蕾缪安有没有和你说过，为什么明明她不是亲生的，小乐的名字，蕾缪乐却是按照她的名字起的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"她在工作时不怎么提她的家庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"其实很简单，在她来到那个家庭时，小乐还没出生，而为了让她融入这个家庭，她们的父母选择了这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然以她们父母不输给小乐的欢乐程度，你说是因为懒得想名字所以这么去取了我觉得也是有可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"总之呢，蕾缪安虽然嘴上不说，心里对于父母是非常感激的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"而对于蕾缪乐这个妹妹，她更是打心眼里爱护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"这和你现在在做的事有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我是这么想的，独臂电锯侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安会同意蕾缪乐离开拉特兰，并不只是因为小乐她说想要来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"她是分得清的人，如果这件事真的对小乐来说变成了某种执念，我不觉得她会放行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰是因为那件事与小乐没有什么关联，对小乐来说寻找我并不是无法放弃的执念——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"她才会能够来到龙门，并且加入企鹅物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安真正希望的，其实是小乐能够出来闯一闯，找到自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"而她将照看小乐的职责，间接地交给了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"明明你不辞而别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"正因我不辞而别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"远远地看一看可算不上照顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我并没有因为她的到来而离开企鹅物流，本来我应该这么做的，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是觉得蕾缪安希望你这么做，你才会这么去做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"也有可能只是我给自己找了一个这么做的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"真意外，你竟然会为自己找了这样一个感性的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是对许多事情没有那么有所谓，又不是绝情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"负罪感，怀念，悲伤，等等等等。这些情感都曾在我心里浮现，只是被我渐渐磨平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"要是被你或者蕾缪安说绝交之类的话，我也会难过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"难过多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，一个星期还是会有的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是够久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"退一万步说，我也算和她们姐妹一起长大，小乐来到我这边，稍微照拂一二也是人之常情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你打算就一直这么下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多？她和她现在的伙伴相处得已经很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，我们会在某些地方偶遇的，但也只是偶遇而已，这样你该放心了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"确实——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我想这么说，但是从我个人角度出发，这对她并不公平，即使我没有资格这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"或许吧。但一切从我成为锁与匙的主人起，就不再有公平可言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有什么事情需要我和她接触，我不会避讳，如果有些话不得不由我告诉她，我会亲口告诉她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"而现实则是——并没有这样的需求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我有我的任务，而这孩子也在这座城市找到了新的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你不觉得这在某种意义上其实很公平吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"......你觉得这样行就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，走吧。等到哪天她倒了大霉被卷进我们这边的事，再继续讨论这个话题吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"独臂电锯侠","speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会让这种事发生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["独臂电锯侠","莫斯提马"]},{"speakerId":"char_300_phenxi","aliases":["独臂电锯侠","苦难陈述者","苦难陈述者？","莫斯提马"]}]}
